###Block: Smoke Para-Genasi
Race Traits ~ Smoke Para-Genasi	CATEGORY:Internal	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|TYPE=SmokeParaGenasi Race Trait
Native Outsider	KEY:Smoke Para-Genasi ~ Native Outsider	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SmokeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:Smoke Para-Genasis are native outsiders.
Elemental Resistance	KEY:Smoke Para-Genasi ~ Elemental Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SmokeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:+%1 racial bonus on saving throws against smoke and cloud effects (such as stinking cloud and cloudkill). The bonus starts at +1 and increases by +1 for every five character levels.|1+floor(TL/5)
Smoke Cloud	KEY:Smoke Para-Genasi ~ Smoke Cloud	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SmokeParaGenasi Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.6	DESC:Once per day (Su), create the smoke cloud effect of the pyrotechnics spell without needing a fire source, as a sorcerer of your character level.
