Thrower	KEY:Unsheltered Halfling ~ Thrower	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:UnshelteredHalfling Race Trait.Race Trait.SpecialQuality	SOURCEPAGE:p.38	DESC:+1 racial bonus on attack rolls with thrown weapons and slings.
