Spirit	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain	SOURCEPAGE:p.1360	DESC:You may create a spiritual bond between an item you have created (usually a doll or similar object) and a single enemy. Creating this item requires 100 gp and a sample of the hair, skin, fingernails, or other bodily material of the victim. You may cast any spell of 3rd level or lower with a touch range on the creature without making a touch attack roll by casting the spell on the bonded object. The creature gains a +2 circumstance bonus on its saving throw (if any) against the effect. You must be within long range (400 ft. + 40 ft. /level) of your target and have line of effect to it to use the object in this manner. You may create one of these items per month, but you may not have more than one active at a time. When you create a new bounded item, your previous one loses its power.|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Remove Domain Power (Spirit)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Domain Power ~ Spirit|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Remove Domain Power (Spirit)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Domain Spells ~ Spirit
Spirit	KEY:Domain Power ~ Spirit	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain Power	SOURCEPAGE:p.1360	DESC:You may create a spiritual bond between an item you have created (usually a doll or similar object) and a single enemy. Creating this item requires 100 gp and a sample of the hair, skin, fingernails, or other bodily material of the victim. You may cast any spell of 3rd level or lower with a touch range on the creature without making a touch attack roll by casting the spell on the bonded object. The creature gains a +2 circumstance bonus on its saving throw (if any) against the effect. You must be within long range (400 ft. + 40 ft. /level) of your target and have line of effect to it to use the object in this manner. You may create one of these items per month, but you may not have more than one active at a time. When you create a new bounded item, your previous one loses its power.
